==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{m|non|vatn}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{m|gem-pro|*watōr}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|fo}} {{m|ine-pro|*wódr̥}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/vaʰtn/|lang=fo}}

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|n|vatns|vøtn}}

# {{lb|fo|uncountable}} [[water]] ([[H₂O]])
# {{lb|fo|nautical}} [[sea]]
# body [[fluid]]
# [[lake]]

====Declension====
{{fo-decl-noun-n5|v|a|tn|ø}}

====Usage notes====
: [[kasta]] [[sær]] [[av]] '''vatni(num)''' - to pee

====Derived terms====
* {{l|fo|tað rennur ikki vatn ímillum}} ([[teirra]]) - "there runs no water between them" (they are best friends)
* {{l|fo|vatn kemur aftur, har vatn hevur verið}} - water comes back, where water has been

